OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell questioned on
OL,4,Acouncil reforms, new GCSEs and small
OL,5,Aboats on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FLabour's deputy leader Lucy Powell is
OL,8,Ftaking part in a series of quick-fire
OL,9,Finterviews on BBC local radio stations
OL,10,F- watch live above
OL,12,FHer party is preparing to host its
OL,13,Fautumn conference in Liverpool from
OL,14,FSunday
OL,16,FBBC Hereford & Worcester pushed Powell
OL,17,Fover the delay in plans to restructure
OL,18,Flocal councils, while BBC Radio
OL,19,FNewcastle quizzed the education
OL,20,Fsecretary on GCSE reforms
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
