OL,3,GNEWSALabour's Lucy Powell questioned on
OL,4,Acouncil reforms, new GCSEs and small
OL,5,Aboats on BBC local radio
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Radio Kent, whose patch includes
OL,8,Fthe port of Dover, focused on the issue
OL,9,Fof small boat arrivals
OL,11,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,12,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,13,Fyears. Leaders of the Conservatives,
OL,14,FGreens, Lib Dems and Reform UK are
OL,15,Fgetting a similar opportunity before
OL,16,Ftheir conferences
OL,18,FPowell is being interviewed live on
OL,19,Fseven stations across England, ending
OL,20,Fwith BBC Radio Shropshire at 10:52 BST
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
